  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Retention Panels for Green Roofs in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ceyes has started up 2 pilot projects in Bogota, Colombia for water retention and green roofs. The company has found a number of companies in Colombia to work with and use old tires to recycle into water retention projects. For these pilot projects, financed by DGGF-TA, Ceyes is producing the products in the Netherlands, installing them in Colombia as showcases, with the ultimate goal of setting up factories in Bogota. Local companies are providing the workers to implement and install the products. The project has so far lead to 2,5 indirect FTE.</narrative>
  </description>
